{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t經中朝雙方商定，中朝新鴨綠江大橋明天正式開通，雙方明天將共同舉行開通儀式。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在北京，外交部發言人毛寧在例行記者會表示，中朝是山水相連的友好鄰邦，新鴨綠江大橋是兩國互聯互通重要設施，開通之後將進一步促進經貿交流和人員往來，增進人民福祉。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.746483+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:36:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:31.461845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.639940+00:00","content_hash":"b52ca04ce4e806fd9a7cfdde1e34efc014cc1f10ff81f58470b8e450a4234afc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}